// Kana's words, one block per language (RDE's localization format: a
// LANGUAGE: line, then ID=text lines). Every block has every id of
// src/text_ids.h; both are made by apps/kana/tools/strings.py: edit it, not
// them. {0}, {1}... are placeholders, {0,plural, one{...} other{...}} counts
// (# the number); an ASCII apostrophe quotes the next character, so write the
// typographic one (U+2019).

// English
EN-US:
@plural = n != 1
